WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.139
No account. No signup. Just lift.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.941
Open the app. There is no account to make. Pick your units, or just tap Skip.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:15.623
Your numbers are all optional. Bar, experience, bodyweight. Skip any of it.

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:23.637
One tap is required. Confirm you are sixteen or older, or that a guardian agrees. Then start training.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:29.162
That is it. You land on Train. No sign in, and no permission pop-ups. Just lift.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.990
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
